":"귀 해부학","level":3,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#_7","text":"귀의 해부학적 구조 (AA1)","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa1/"]},{"title":"이침 배혈 예시","level":3,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#_8","text":"금연 목적의 이침 배혈 예시 (AA2)\n체중관리 목적의 이침 배혈 예시 (AA3)\n→ WHO 표준 361경혈 임상 아틀라스","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/standard-atlas/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"두경부","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"상지","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"하지","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"배부·기타","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#_5"},{"level":2,"title":"해부학·이침 참고자료","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#supplementary-materials"},{"level":3,"title":"표면해부학적 위치 확인","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#_6"},{"level":3,"title":"귀 해부학","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#_7"},{"level":3,"title":"이침 배혈 예시","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/#_8"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/standard-atlas/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa1/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b1/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b2/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b3/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b4/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b5/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-poi